sequenceDiagram
    participant MCPClient
    participant CaseDocServer
    participant CaseDocRAGGraph
    participant QueryRewriter
    participant BranchDocSelector
    participant RetrievalNode
    participant RetrievalGrader
    participant AnswerGenerator
    participant MergeNode
    participant Qdrant

    MCPClient->>CaseDocServer: JSON-RPC tools/call(search_case_docs, query, case_id)
    CaseDocServer->>CaseDocRAGGraph: invoke(query, case_id, conversation_history)

    CaseDocRAGGraph->>QueryRewriter: rewrite + decompose query [LLM]
    QueryRewriter-->>CaseDocRAGGraph: [sub_question_1, sub_question_2, ...]

    CaseDocRAGGraph->>CaseDocRAGGraph: questionClassifier — on-topic check

    CaseDocRAGGraph->>CaseDocRAGGraph: documentSelector — fetch doc titles (no LLM)

    par parallel Send() per sub-question branch
        CaseDocRAGGraph->>BranchDocSelector: classify sub_question mode
        alt retrieve_specific_doc
            BranchDocSelector->>Qdrant: fetch full document by doc_id
            Qdrant-->>BranchDocSelector: document
            BranchDocSelector-->>CaseDocRAGGraph: branch_result (short-circuit)
        else restrict_to_doc or no_doc_specified
            BranchDocSelector->>RetrievalNode: vector search (with optional doc filter)
            RetrievalNode->>Qdrant: similarity search (case_id filter)
            Qdrant-->>RetrievalNode: chunks[]
            RetrievalNode-->>RetrievalGrader: chunks[]
            RetrievalGrader->>RetrievalGrader: grade relevance [LLM]
            alt pass
                RetrievalGrader->>AnswerGenerator: generate answer [LLM]
                AnswerGenerator-->>CaseDocRAGGraph: branch_result
            else fail and rephrase_count < 2
                RetrievalGrader->>QueryRewriter: rephrase sub-question
                QueryRewriter-->>RetrievalNode: rephrased query
                RetrievalNode->>Qdrant: retry search
                Qdrant-->>RetrievalNode: chunks[]
                RetrievalNode-->>RetrievalGrader: chunks[]
                RetrievalGrader->>AnswerGenerator: generate answer
                AnswerGenerator-->>CaseDocRAGGraph: branch_result
            else fail and rephrase_count >= 2
                RetrievalGrader->>AnswerGenerator: cannot_answer
                AnswerGenerator-->>CaseDocRAGGraph: branch_result (cannot_answer)
            end
        end
    end

    CaseDocRAGGraph->>MergeNode: merge all branch_results [high LLM]
    MergeNode-->>CaseDocRAGGraph: merged response + sources + citation_integrity

    CaseDocRAGGraph-->>CaseDocServer: result
    CaseDocServer-->>MCPClient: JSON-RPC response (answer, sources, citation_integrity)
